Hi Avery,

Here's what's new in your Brex account this month.

Travel booking
Book flights and hotels inside Brex with your company's policy applied automatically. Receipts and itemization happen on their own.

Budget alerts
Set a threshold on any budget and the owner gets a Slack or email nudge at 50%, 80% and 100%.

Faster reimbursements
Employee reimbursements now pay out same day when approved before 2pm PT.

Also: the mobile app has a redesigned approvals inbox, and card controls now support per-merchant limits.

See everything new: https://brex.com/product-updates/march-2026

